OVERVIEW: Update an existing DICOMDIR with new files

USAGE: dicom-dcmdir update <dicomdir-path> [--add <add>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <dicomdir-path>         Path to existing DICOMDIR file

OPTIONS:
  --add <add>             Directory with new DICOM files to add
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

